  "description": "A bindable, book-style page-curl control for .NET MAUI, rendered with SkiaSharp. Drag from any edge to turn pages, with programmatic Animate/AnimateFrom/AnimateToStart/AnimateToEnd commands (sync, async, and ICommand), a bindable TurnSpeed, and an ICurlView : IView surface usable from any view.",
  "id": "Plugin.CurlEffect",
